WEBVTT

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:28.900
Attention please.

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:34.050
This flight is currently flying through some turbulence en route to Tokyo.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:42.810
We would request that all passengers, please verify that your seat belts are in place and remain seated.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.030
Erica!

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:00.200
Erica! Erica!

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.990
Excuse me, Sir, is something wrong?

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:02.830
Is there a doctor?!

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:05.290
Is anyone here a doctor?!

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:10.380
Are you a doctor?

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:11.170
Yes.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.300
Doctor, will my wife be okay?

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:21.140
She's in a state of shock. I suspect a pulmonary embolism.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:28.650
If we don't operate soon her life could be at risk.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:34.280
Bring her to a hospital. Tell them prepare Bosmin and Protanol.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.070
Right!

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:46.710
To treat an emergency patient, this flight will be redirected to the nearest airport, Incheon International in South Korea.

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:00.140
Get a defibrillator ready, immediately!

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.230
Strange, these symptoms are...

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:11.610
It can't be!

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.610
Keep quiet.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:19.610
You will follow our orders from here on out.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.990
Dr. Black Jack.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:26.540
We welcome you, Doctor...

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:28.960
To our nation, Anryon.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:43.470
Karte 12 - The Beautiful Avenger

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:12.080
<i>Utagau hodo ni shinjiru mae ni sono mae ni
As much as you doubt it, before you believe it, even before that...</i>

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:21.220
<i>Ushinau hodo ni motomeru mae ni sayonara wo
As much as you would lose it, before you seek it, bid it farewell.</i>

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:30.430
<i>Kono mama zutto egao wo mitsumete itai dake sa
I just want to see you smile like this forever.</i>

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:40.320
<i>Kioku to iu ryouude ni kimi wo daite
 Holding you in these arms called memories.</i>

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:44.570
<i>Tabidachi wa ima shikkoku no toki
We set out now, when it is darkest.</i>

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:48.370
<i>Haruka no yami no mukou ni
 To go to a place beyond the darkness.</i>

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:53.500
<i>Mada kyou wa naku mashite kinou ni wa tooku
We're not there yet today but it was even more distant yesterday.</i>

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:59.420
<i>Darkest time just before the sunrise.
Darkest time just before the sunrise.</i>

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:07.800
<i>Hito ni namae wo tazuneraretara tabibito to
When people ask your name, call yourself a traveler.</i>

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:16.730
<i>Tatta sore dake kotaete hoshii sore dake wo
That's all I want you to answer. Just that.</i>

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:25.910
<i>Yukue mo tsugezu wakare no kotoba mo nokosanaide
Tell no one where you're going and leave no farewells.</i>

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:35.960
<i>Dokoka he kiete shimatta dake no hito to
Be someone who simply wandered off somewhere and disappeared.</i>

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:44.050
<i>Samishiku wa nai shitteiru kara saigo wa itsumo hitori to
It's not lonely because, you know, in the end you're always alone.</i>

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:48.930
<i>Dakara kokoro wo tojite koko ni tadoritsuku
So close your heart and reach this place.</i>

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:54.850
<i>Darkest time just before the sunrise.
Darkest time just before the sunrise.</i>

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:02.570
<i>Tabidachi wa ima shikkoku no toki
We set out now, when it is darkest.</i>

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:06.910
<i>Haruka na yami no mukou ni
 To go to a place beyond the darkness.</i>

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:15.710
<i>Samishiku wa nai shitteiru kara saigo wa itsumo hitori to
It's not lonely because, you know, in the end you're always alone.</i>

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:20.170
<i>Tabidachi wa ima shikkoku no toki
We set out now, when it is darkest.</i>

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:24.630
<i>Haruka na yami no mukou ni
 To go to a place beyond the darkness.</i>

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:59.250
At this ceremony celebrating the 40th anniversary of the founding of our nation, Anryon...

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:11.930
The great General Che Hyoku, his eldest son Admiral Tebyon and his second son Jongi have shown shown us their energetic faces.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:22.610
They have arrived.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:23.400
Let them in.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:37.540
This is the governor of Anryon, General Che Hyoku.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.330
You people get out.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.960
You are a surgeon who makes the impossible possible.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.800
Hearing your reputation, The General decided to invite you to our country.

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.550
We would very much like to have you treat The General.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.930
If you do, we will let you leave this country unharmed.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:04.690
Don't make me laugh.

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:10.780
I've no intent to treat the sort of self-righteous prick who would have me abducted.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:12.820
Doctor...

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:17.790
I do believe you would be best to consider the position you are in at the moment.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.350
General, be strong!

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:43.730
Hang in there, General!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:55.110
I've given him a sedative so I think he should be asleep for a little while.

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:59.490
I do think we've done something terribly unfair to you, Doctor.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:06.330
We couldn't allow the illness of the General who holds together twenty million people to be noticed by a foreign power.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:11.260
To tell you the truth, many world famous doctors have been unable to treat The General.

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.720
It's a difficult case...

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:18.260
You must have some interest as a doctor, don't you?

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:21.180
Kan, explain for him.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.520
I am his head doctor, Kan.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:27.610
I will show you some data and medical charts on The General in my research room.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:33.950
The General suffers from a type of brain tumour, a glioma. It's in its final stages...

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:38.620
To treat it, as usual, one must open the skull and remove the tumour.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:42.950
In that case, providing anaesthetic becomes the problem.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:46.620
The anaesthetic will produce an anaphylactic reaction...

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:58.260
The General's anaphylaxy is a strong allergic reaction to anaesthetic drugs.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:04.560
There is the risk that the anaesthetic will put him into a state of shock which may lead to death.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:08.060
We can not use any anaesthetic on The General.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:11.230
In other words, we can not operate.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:19.740
I understand this is difficult. The other doctors were all terrified and unwilling to even hold a scalpel.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:23.950
However, we are out of time, Dr. Black Jack.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.960
You are our last hope!

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:29.040
The General can't die yet!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.630
300 million.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:38.260
Also, my immediate release on completion of the procedure. Those are my conditions.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.810
Glioma... A brain tumour.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:53.230
In The General's case, because the border between the tumour and healthy cells is indistinct, removing it will be incredibly difficult.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:56.570
Furthermore, his symptoms are in a fairly advanced state.

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:02.950
He has been subjected to radiation treatment twice. Further exposure may have negative side effects.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:09.210
At this point, the only way to remove it is through surgery, but anaesthetic will prove an issue.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:15.000
There is no pain in the brain. If I can open his skull I should be able to manage.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:18.010
If I can remove the pain until it is open...

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:24.260
However, if I choose the wrong anaesthetic, there may be oxygen deprivation and a reduction in blood pressure.

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:27.430
The arrhythmia may lead to cardiac arrest. In other words, death.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:35.190
I have prepared lodging for you at a nearby hotel.

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:38.360
Have no fear, I have arranged a powerful bodyguard for you.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:42.200
One of your former patients is coming.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.380
A member of the Radical Forces. Her codename is "L".

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.360
I see.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.730
Black Jack has agreed to operate, has he?

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:25.410
As a condition, he says he wants you to stop smoking, General.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:30.000
You want to order me around, Black Jack?

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.970
What did you do that day in the airplane?

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:43.970
I swallowed potassium cyanide.

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:47.180
Had you made even a little mistake, you'd be dead...

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:52.850
Doctor!

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.270
Speed up! Shake them off!

00:11:59.030 --> 00:11:59.530
Yes Ma'am!

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:13.920
Doctor, are you hurt?

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.210
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.130
What happened?

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.420
Nothing to do with you, Doctor.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:31.770
We were ambushed by Fanlon again?

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.770
I'm terribly sorry, Sir Tebyon...

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.900
Well then, what was the damage?

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:40.020
The warehouse connected to the Defence Factory has been half destroyed.

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:42.570
Military vehicles have been stolen and there are a number of casualties.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:46.990
A large number of weapons have vanished and the flag of the Fanlon Liberation Army was found inside.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:52.450
Raise the security on all military facilities to the maximum!

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:54.160
Don't let a single ant in!

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:58.710
Damn...! This happened as soon as The General's condition took a turn for the worse!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.670
Is information leaking out?

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.550
Please, remain calm.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:05.510
Almost the entire army is in the palm of your hand, Sir Tebyon.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.550
You must remain calm and self-possessed in times like this.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.810
Is it really like that?

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:14.770
If my father were to declare Jongi his heir...

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.440
There's no need to worry about such things.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:21.440
The General's chance of survival is practically zero.

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:25.110
You need only wait for the time to come, Sir Tebyon.

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.780
I'll leave it to you.

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:28.660
As you wish, Sir Tebyon.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.880
Occasional spasms are one of the symptoms of glioma.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.550
I've given him some Valium.

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.390
Good work, Dr. Black Jack.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:54.020
General, how is your health?

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.030
Tebyon!!

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:07.190
How long are you going to let Fanlon do as they please?!

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:09.700
I'm sorry!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:21.330
I will capture the members of Fanlon as soon as possible and show the people what happens to those who defy our authority!

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:24.340
Please, wait! Won't you hear what I have to say?

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.130
Huh? What do you want to say, Jongi?

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:33.220
Father, you laid the foundation for our nation amidst the expectations of various foreign countries.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.720
But the people are in despair!

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:40.640
Starvation has become common and the sense of despair has begun to spread rapidly among the troops as well.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:44.360
Fanlon was created by rebellious elements amongst the people!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.190
We have to deal with the root of the problem!

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.860
You're taking Fanlon's side?

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:51.860
No, I didn't mean it that way.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:55.580
I've heard enough. Both of you, leave!

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:58.500
Brother!

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.370
I want to talk to you about something.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:02.880
What is it?

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:07.210
If you become General, will you follow the same path as our father?

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:09.840
That goes without saying.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:11.380
That won't work!

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:15.430
We'll be criticized by the international community and some day this nation will collapse!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:24.770
Do you know what our father did when he first became General?

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:28.820
He had his siblings and political opponents transferred elsewhere...

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:31.240
Then executed.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:41.620
I think we would be better off thinking about what's best for ourselves rather than the country.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.370
Well, I'll be going.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.460
I'm busy with the Fanlon Annihilation Operation, you see.

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:57.720
Once again, I read over the various methods that many great doctors had tried on The General in past.

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:01.930
There, I found one blind spot.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.610
Electro-anaesthesia?

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.110
Yes.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:15.160
I plan to use that to stop the pain when I open and close your skull.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.660
There are past cases, but the results are uncertain.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:21.410
At present, that method is not guaranteed to work.

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:26.750
At the point it became impossible to preform an ordinary operation there was already no guaranteed way of handling it.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:30.250
You can't be telling me you plan to experiment on The General!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.510
That's not my intention.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:35.010
There is no way of operating without some risk.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.970
My head's going to split!

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:46.900
L, please, do something about this headache!

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:53.940
So, there was something even the General who had terrified many small nations in the region could not control.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:59.070
The effects of electro-anaesthesia vary from person to person.

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:03.790
First, it is necessary to make detailed observations about The General's vital signs.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:07.960
Then, it was necessary to verify the strength of electricity to be used.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:11.960
If the current is too weak the patient may go into shock.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:14.970
If it's too strong, it may damage the patient's body.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.590
In some cases, that could lead to cardiac arrest.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:22.140
As such, It was necessary to determine the proper amount of electrical power.

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:26.230
This has become problematic...

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:31.480
If somehow Black Jack successfully treats him, The General will return to political life.

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:36.240
If that happens, the succession issue may disappear.

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.490
Before then, we have to do something!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.040
I'll leave it to you.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.120
Understood.

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:57.340
Can you really treat The General?

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.010
Yes, that is what I plan to do.

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:01.510
I want you to heal him.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.510
No matter what it takes.

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:23.870
I'm sorry, are you alright?

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.370
A package was left here for that customer.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:31.670
From who?

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.210
I'm not sure. They didn't leave a name.

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:42.550
Doctor, it's a bomb!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.800
This bomb was from our military.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:19.760
It's dangerous to stay here...!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.430
Ow, it hurts...!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:29.270
You'll be fine. It's not a bad cut.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:31.600
Doctor, we're leaving right now.

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:40.150
That bomb was meant for us.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:40.990
What?

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:42.450
The back exit is this way.

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:45.740
There they are!

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:05.010
L!

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:08.640
A separate military faction not controlled by The General is on the move!

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:13.140
Those who don't want you to operate on The General.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:37.710
What?! Black Jack and L vanished after an explosion at their hotel?!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:39.840
Yes. The hotel has been half-destroyed.

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:42.720
We haven't verified the number of wounded yet, but...

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.550
We believe there is no hope of them having survived.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:49.220
Black Jack was...

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.900
Up ahead, there's an old military training camp.

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:59.480
Okay, I'll remove the bullet there.

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:33.720
All of the necessary disinfectants and antibiotics like penicillin are here.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:45.440
Luckily, the bullet hasn't damaged the heart or major arteries.

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:50.490
However, her pulse and blood pressure have dropped and her body is heavily drained.

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:53.580
I must operate as soon as possible.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:55.500
Doctor...

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:58.330
I will now remove the bullet.

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:01.420
But the surgical implements available here are limited.

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:03.840
This is going to involve a lot of pain.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:07.010
I will bear it!

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:12.550
I still have things I need to do! Until then, I can not die!

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:15.220
I'm starting the operation.

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:35.160
To remove the bullet, I first have to cut with the scalpel to reopen the bullet wound that is beginning to close.

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:39.120
I wish I had a little more light...

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:47.800
The bullet has dug its way in quite deep.

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:52.640
I need to carefully remove it so as not to injure the arteries.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:05.980
L! Hang in there! L!

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:28.130
Jongi... Will you not change your views on my political power?

00:23:32.380 --> 00:23:33.340
I see...

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:43.730
With my body in this state, I have to think about what will happen once I am gone.

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:47.730
General, don't be so dispirited. There are still things we can do!

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:51.400
Jongi, I will appoint you as ambassador to Russia.

00:23:51.900 --> 00:23:54.110
Get out of this country now!

00:23:54.110 --> 00:23:54.910
Father!

00:23:55.490 --> 00:23:57.330
Then, you mean, I will be...

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:02.660
Tebyon, I leave the rest to you.

00:24:03.370 --> 00:24:11.050
I understand. I will accept only for as long as it takes your health to recover, General.

00:24:14.090 --> 00:24:17.300
The hotel bombing was even more effective than we had expected.

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:23.190
I am making sure that L and Black Jack never appear before The General again.

00:24:26.270 --> 00:24:32.950
And, tomorrow morning, we will set off the best fireworks to show the transfer of power to everyone inside and outside the country.

00:24:32.950 --> 00:24:36.200
Fireworks...? Hey, wait, you're going to do that?

00:24:36.990 --> 00:24:40.490
It will be fine. Leave it to me.

00:24:41.790 --> 00:24:42.960
General.

00:24:56.300 --> 00:24:59.300
That's cute. It looks good on you, Ajun.

00:24:59.300 --> 00:25:00.970
Thank you, Mom.

00:25:07.150 --> 00:25:09.230
Why?! Why me?!

00:25:12.360 --> 00:25:13.570
Dad!

00:25:14.700 --> 00:25:16.150
Dad!!

00:25:18.950 --> 00:25:21.910
Let my wife go! Please, spare my daughter!

00:25:22.410 --> 00:25:25.410
Dad!!

00:25:29.460 --> 00:25:30.880
I was dreaming.

00:25:31.670 --> 00:25:33.380
A nightmare that will never end.

00:25:34.550 --> 00:25:36.510
When I was still young...

00:25:37.220 --> 00:25:41.350
My family were tricked by The General into coming to this country.

00:25:41.810 --> 00:25:45.980
My father, a scientist, refused to cooperate with The General and was executed.

00:25:47.810 --> 00:25:49.400
My mother was always crying.

00:25:50.150 --> 00:25:52.650
Crying that she wanted to return to our homeland, as a family.

00:25:53.690 --> 00:25:56.610
Later, my mother was forced to become The General's wife.

00:25:57.200 --> 00:25:59.530
She gave birth to a single son and died.

00:26:00.570 --> 00:26:02.530
Why did you become a soldier?

00:26:02.780 --> 00:26:06.910
When my mother was forced to marry The General, I was put in a detention camp.

00:26:06.910 --> 00:26:09.330
But I escaped and joined the military.

00:26:10.380 --> 00:26:16.920
In this country, there was no way for someone like me to survive other than as a disposable soldier.

00:26:17.800 --> 00:26:20.640
At that moment, I cast aside my true name.

00:26:27.770 --> 00:26:31.610
L was my code name in The General's forces.

00:26:32.690 --> 00:26:36.070
I lived on, swearing vengeance against The General.

00:26:36.990 --> 00:26:38.530
I won't let him die of illness.

00:26:39.700 --> 00:26:41.570
I'll take my revenge on him with my own hands.

00:26:42.370 --> 00:26:45.200
I will wait for an opportunity to go treat The General.

00:26:47.700 --> 00:26:50.500
You were forced to come here and people are even trying to kill you.

00:26:50.500 --> 00:26:54.130
Yet you're still willing to risk your life for a man like that?! Why?!

00:26:55.250 --> 00:26:59.670
No matter who they are, to me, everyone is just a patient suffering from some illness.

00:27:00.680 --> 00:27:01.640
And...

00:27:03.760 --> 00:27:05.100
I am a doctor.

00:27:16.900 --> 00:27:22.200
Due to The General's illness I will be handling all of his duties.

00:27:22.200 --> 00:27:24.620
My orders are the orders of The General.

00:27:25.330 --> 00:27:28.620
Our nation will now open the door to greatness and prosperity!

00:27:28.620 --> 00:27:33.040
Complete this mission for the dignity of our nation!

00:27:37.960 --> 00:27:55.230
{'\an8}Hail Tebyon! Hail Tebyon! Hail Tebyon!

00:27:42.970 --> 00:27:45.220
Begin the test immediately.

00:27:45.220 --> 00:27:49.220
Show the power of our new General to the world!

00:27:55.810 --> 00:28:01.700
{'\an8}Hail Tebyon! Hail Tebyon!

00:28:16.960 --> 00:28:19.250
Doctor, we should move.

00:28:31.270 --> 00:28:32.850
What do you plan to do now?

00:28:33.730 --> 00:28:36.150
I'll have you go into hiding for some time.

00:28:36.900 --> 00:28:38.730
I need to gather information.

00:28:45.610 --> 00:28:46.740
The spring is coming.

00:28:49.120 --> 00:28:50.450
The birds are crying.

00:28:51.240 --> 00:28:52.080
Birds?

00:28:53.250 --> 00:28:57.500
There's an old legend that says when you hear these birds in the mountains spring is coming.

00:29:01.960 --> 00:29:04.050
I could hear them too.

00:29:06.130 --> 00:29:08.430
Is that so? You heard them too, Doctor?

00:29:09.140 --> 00:29:10.100
You look happy.

00:29:11.970 --> 00:29:14.100
There's more to that legend.

00:29:14.810 --> 00:29:15.640
What is it?

00:29:17.230 --> 00:29:18.730
Don't laugh, Doctor.

00:29:20.400 --> 00:29:23.360
If you hear those birds with the person you love...

00:29:23.780 --> 00:29:26.110
It means you will be bound together.

00:29:29.240 --> 00:29:32.410
But it's just a worthless old legend.

00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:36.870
Fanlon?!

00:29:56.640 --> 00:29:58.600
L?! Dr. Black Jack?!

00:29:58.940 --> 00:30:00.810
You two survived!

00:30:00.810 --> 00:30:02.770
These people are my guests.

00:30:02.770 --> 00:30:04.860
Everyone, lower your weapons.

00:30:06.650 --> 00:30:08.200
Sorry about that.

00:30:08.200 --> 00:30:10.660
I'll lead you to our camp.

00:30:11.740 --> 00:30:14.830
What are you doing with the members of Fanlon, Jongi?

00:30:16.250 --> 00:30:19.000
I am the leader of Fanlon.

00:30:22.710 --> 00:30:24.000
Say, what?!

00:30:24.630 --> 00:30:27.340
You're telling me Jongi is the leader of Fanlon?!

00:30:27.340 --> 00:30:31.970
Right now, Fanlon is causing disturbances all over the city.

00:30:33.260 --> 00:30:35.970
Arrest Jongi for treason!

00:30:38.350 --> 00:30:44.730
Currently, in this camp we are protecting children who fled the city and people who have escaped from the detainment camps.

00:30:45.320 --> 00:30:48.070
Just how grave the situation in this country is...

00:30:48.070 --> 00:30:50.240
Just how much our people are suffering...

00:30:50.240 --> 00:30:52.490
I wanted to show my father and brother that.

00:30:53.280 --> 00:30:57.450
This morning, finally, my brother carried out a nuclear test.

00:30:58.000 --> 00:31:02.500
If this continues, our country will be isolated internationally.

00:31:03.040 --> 00:31:08.800
What?! Fanlon has broken through our defence line and they're advancing towards Labour Party Headquarters?!

00:31:10.430 --> 00:31:13.680
Fanlon is demanding The General retire?!

00:31:14.680 --> 00:31:17.850
Right now, half of the soldiers in this country are supporters of Fanlon!

00:31:18.220 --> 00:31:20.730
It's only a matter of time until this country changes!

00:31:33.990 --> 00:31:35.580
Take care of Dr. Black Jack!

00:31:50.590 --> 00:31:52.180
Stay here, Doctor.

00:31:52.180 --> 00:31:53.970
Make sure you don't move!

00:31:54.430 --> 00:31:54.930
Jongi!

00:31:55.760 --> 00:31:57.100
Hey! What are you going to do?!

00:31:57.560 --> 00:31:59.600
There are still children back in the tents!

00:32:09.360 --> 00:32:10.530
This is...

00:32:23.790 --> 00:32:24.790
Jongi!

00:32:49.320 --> 00:32:50.320
Jongi...

00:32:52.610 --> 00:32:54.450
Don't die, Jongi!!

00:33:03.660 --> 00:33:06.170
Doctor, save Jongi!

00:33:10.340 --> 00:33:13.590
The artery is damaged. He's lost a lot of blood.

00:33:14.800 --> 00:33:16.760
We need to give him a transfusion soon!

00:33:17.180 --> 00:33:21.510
Jongi's blood is type O, Rh negative, it's rare.

00:33:21.510 --> 00:33:23.730
None of the members of Fanlon here have it.

00:33:24.730 --> 00:33:26.140
Of all things...

00:33:26.560 --> 00:33:29.690
My blood is also type O, Rh negative.

00:33:29.940 --> 00:33:31.020
Use mine.

00:33:31.440 --> 00:33:34.900
But you've just injured your arm and chest.

00:33:35.650 --> 00:33:40.910
If you give blood right now, you may die yourself from blood loss.

00:33:40.910 --> 00:33:43.160
I don't care what happens to me!

00:33:43.830 --> 00:33:45.290
I want to save my little brother!

00:33:46.040 --> 00:33:47.080
Your brother?!

00:33:53.840 --> 00:33:54.800
Body temperature dropping.

00:33:55.920 --> 00:33:57.300
Blood pressure dropping.

00:33:58.300 --> 00:34:02.260
There was a risk of infection but I decided to carry out the transfusion directly.

00:34:12.400 --> 00:34:13.530
Mother...

00:34:20.620 --> 00:34:21.740
Mother...

00:34:23.120 --> 00:34:26.540
He's confused due to the heavy blood loss.

00:34:38.090 --> 00:34:41.090
Jongi doesn't know that I am his sister.

00:34:45.310 --> 00:34:47.730
I have no intent of telling him.

00:34:48.270 --> 00:34:50.770
I've done horrible things.

00:34:51.560 --> 00:34:53.570
I really can't tell him who I am.

00:34:55.110 --> 00:35:01.660
Even if something happens to me, I wonder if I will be able to live on inside Jongi...

00:35:04.160 --> 00:35:04.950
Yeah.

00:35:24.510 --> 00:35:28.390
L and Jongi had both stabilised after the procedure.

00:35:29.810 --> 00:35:32.230
Doctor, thank you so much.

00:35:32.730 --> 00:35:35.150
This is good bye. Take care.

00:35:41.780 --> 00:35:44.320
You've helped me twice now, Doctor.

00:35:45.330 --> 00:35:47.200
You're the one who saved Jongi.

00:35:49.290 --> 00:35:52.670
I've done nothing but take the lives of others up until now.

00:35:54.330 --> 00:35:56.840
Is this the first time I've saved someone?

00:35:58.000 --> 00:36:00.510
You saved his life.

00:36:02.300 --> 00:36:04.840
I want Jongi to keep on living.

00:36:06.180 --> 00:36:08.890
Because he's my only remaining blood relative.

00:36:12.310 --> 00:36:17.230
Doctor, for The General's operation... Let me assist you.

00:36:34.620 --> 00:36:37.090
Black Jack? L?

00:36:41.590 --> 00:36:43.010
You're far too late.

00:36:45.090 --> 00:36:47.680
I've lost my grasp on everything.

00:36:49.220 --> 00:36:51.720
I have nothing left.

00:36:52.520 --> 00:36:54.890
Will you still treat me?

00:36:57.150 --> 00:37:02.110
For me, you are still a single patient suffering from illness.

00:37:12.660 --> 00:37:18.500
Based on the electro-anaesthesia simulation, we must finish the operation within 30 minutes or the anaesthesia will lose its effect.

00:37:22.880 --> 00:37:24.340
Begin the electro-anaesthesia.

00:37:24.340 --> 00:37:25.130
Right.

00:37:32.270 --> 00:37:34.930
Vitals are stable. Sense of pain is okay as well.

00:37:36.190 --> 00:37:40.440
I will quickly cut open his skull and remove the tumour which has formed on his brain.

00:37:57.750 --> 00:38:00.080
The General is regaining consciousness.

00:38:00.080 --> 00:38:00.960
Yeah.

00:38:00.960 --> 00:38:04.800
The electro-anaesthesia is losing its effect. We haven't a moment to spare.

00:38:04.800 --> 00:38:06.670
We have to struggle for every second!

00:38:10.550 --> 00:38:12.180
The glioma is worsening!

00:38:12.600 --> 00:38:14.470
It's invading the other nerves.

00:38:41.540 --> 00:38:43.040
The operation is complete.

00:38:51.840 --> 00:38:52.640
Doctor.

00:38:53.220 --> 00:38:54.350
Good work.

00:38:54.350 --> 00:38:54.970
Yeah.

00:39:21.000 --> 00:39:22.880
You're going to shoot me?

00:39:25.710 --> 00:39:29.510
When I saw you in the special squad a few years ago I knew immediately.

00:39:30.050 --> 00:39:31.300
That you were Ajun.

00:39:31.840 --> 00:39:32.930
You knew?!

00:39:33.510 --> 00:39:36.600
You're the daughter of a woman I sought with all of my heart.

00:39:36.600 --> 00:39:38.390
That's why I kept you by my side.

00:39:39.310 --> 00:39:41.020
My father... My mother...

00:39:42.100 --> 00:39:43.060
I won't forgive you!

00:39:47.280 --> 00:39:48.990
Very well, shoot.

00:39:51.610 --> 00:39:52.410
Stop!

00:39:57.200 --> 00:39:58.740
Out of my way, Doctor.

00:39:59.250 --> 00:40:01.620
I have to take my revenge on him.

00:40:02.040 --> 00:40:06.500
I can't forgive the general who killed my mother and father!

00:40:08.670 --> 00:40:11.340
Put this behind you and move forward.

00:40:15.140 --> 00:40:16.010
Move!

00:40:32.450 --> 00:40:33.030
L!

00:40:34.910 --> 00:40:38.080
Those who oppose me are like germs.

00:40:38.910 --> 00:40:42.710
They must be completely eliminated. As if surgically removing a cancer.

00:40:44.000 --> 00:40:45.830
Isn't that right, Doctor?

00:40:47.080 --> 00:40:50.130
She just wanted to lead a normal happy life.

00:40:51.210 --> 00:40:56.550
Having her family stolen away and her heart frozen, she burned only with a desire for revenge against you.

00:40:57.680 --> 00:41:01.810
I've never regretted anything I've done as a doctor more than what I did today, Che Hyoku!

00:41:01.810 --> 00:41:04.310
I regret operating on you!

00:41:17.110 --> 00:41:18.530
L! Be strong!

00:41:20.030 --> 00:41:24.620
But the loss off blood from her abdomen was intense and the situation was already hopeless.

00:41:25.870 --> 00:41:31.590
Doctor... I couldn't take the life you saved.

00:41:35.680 --> 00:41:39.510
I... I want to see my mother's homeland.

00:41:41.390 --> 00:41:42.850
I'll take you there.

00:41:48.480 --> 00:41:52.230
Doctor, it's too late for me, isn't it?

00:41:54.570 --> 00:41:57.410
You'll be fine. I'll definitely cure you.

00:42:04.540 --> 00:42:07.000
You're an awful liar, Doctor.

00:42:08.670 --> 00:42:11.290
I wish I could have been together with you longer.

00:42:16.550 --> 00:42:17.970
It's quiet...

00:42:17.970 --> 00:42:22.640
Almost as if... we're the only two people left in the world...

00:42:49.290 --> 00:42:50.420
Doctor...

00:42:52.290 --> 00:42:54.380
I'm glad I met you...

00:42:57.300 --> 00:42:59.380
L, can you hear them?

00:43:00.300 --> 00:43:02.090
Those birds are crying.

00:43:09.770 --> 00:43:13.230
I'll show that heartless doctor for leaving me alone for a whole week without calling!

00:43:13.810 --> 00:43:15.520
I'll clobber him! Clobber him! Clobber him!

00:43:15.520 --> 00:43:17.230
Clobber him! Clobber him! Clobber him!

00:43:22.780 --> 00:43:25.370
Doctor, you're back.

00:43:25.370 --> 00:43:26.040
Yeah.

00:43:32.880 --> 00:43:34.170
Honestly!

00:43:35.540 --> 00:43:37.800
I was so worried about you!

00:43:37.800 --> 00:43:39.050
News flash.

00:43:39.590 --> 00:43:45.760
The civil war in Anryon which has raged for the past several days concluded with the capture of General Che Hyoku.

00:43:45.760 --> 00:43:48.560
A complete victory for the Jongi Revolutionary Army.

00:43:50.140 --> 00:43:56.570
The new government has accepted IAEA nuclear inspections and announced its intent to work towards becoming a new nation.

00:44:11.250 --> 00:44:14.000
If you hear these birds with someone you love.

00:44:14.750 --> 00:44:16.590
It means you will be bound together.

00:44:47.700 --> 00:44:52.450
Kaeritsuita machi wa
The town I returned to...

00:44:54.670 --> 00:45:00.000
Omokage no kakera mo misezu
Wasn't how I remembered it at all.

00:45:01.210 --> 00:45:12.430
Garasu no jouheki ga zutto narande iru dake
There was nothing but glass walls going on forever.

00:45:13.480 --> 00:45:19.270
Matte ite hoshii
I want you to wait for me.

00:45:20.320 --> 00:45:25.990
Ano hi nomikonda tsubuyaki ga
For the whisper I swallowed that day.

00:45:26.860 --> 00:45:33.000
Matte ite hoshii
I want you to wait for me.

00:45:33.790 --> 00:45:42.460
Ima mo azayaka na kizuguchi wo hiraku
Now, the wounds open, still fresh.

00:45:42.460 --> 00:45:49.180
Kousou biru no sukima kara sashikomu tsuki no hikari
The moonlight pokes through the gaps in the highrise buildings.

00:45:49.760 --> 00:45:56.190
Omae mo dareka wo sagashi tsudzukete iru no ka
Are you still searching for someone too?

00:45:56.190 --> 00:46:02.940
Eien ni kawaranai yasuragi wa tabi no kanata
Unchanging, peace lies at the end of our journey.

00:46:02.940 --> 00:46:08.110
Sora no hate ni shika nokotte inai no ka
Does it only remain beyond the skies?

00:46:11.410 --> 00:46:15.960
But I'll be back again.
But I'll be back again.
